197
00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.590
your loss is not capped,

198
00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.070
and the exchange can close you out.

199
00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.080
Harder and riskier, which is why

200
00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.010
this tier is called Expert.

201
00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:46.800
Shorts lose too: this rotation shorted SUI

202
00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.670
and closed it two days later at

203
00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.870
minus three point seven percent.

204
00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.080
Long and short strategies are in early

205
00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.390
access and their results are preliminary.

206
00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.160
Read them as a rule's history,

207
00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:59.030
not as a promise.

208
00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.830
Filter what you care about:

209
00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.150
sovereign or rotation, daily or twelve-hour,

210
00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.310
with shorts, with stocks.

211
00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.050
Every plan includes the daily

212
00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.250
signal of each card,

213
00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.190
the full card with its backtest,

214
00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:13.590
